        "quote": "(a) Subject to the provisions of K.S.A. 12-2001 and amendments thereto, there is hereby granted to Grantee this nonexclusive Contract Franchise to provide telecommunications services to the consumers or recipients of such service located within the corporate boundaries of the City, for the term of this Contract Franchise, subject to the terms and conditions of this Contract Franchise.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:axb-art.-iii-2:block:0#text",
